                <l xml:id="m-5061225d-1250-4bc3-8ac6-5edf48189a49" facs="#m-6a169c87-5994-4f92-8d73-f14287f22f32" label="text-like">The Mass of the Paschal Vigil</l><l xml:id="m-0f3a2e7b-eb33-44f9-8879-beba705966eb" facs="#m-4543ae08-8b1d-4ec2-bab6-768b461df74c" label="ambiguous">T7614</l><l xml:id="m-cb5134b4-cedc-4d42-b329-1449fcce55bc" facs="#m-21bc7381-9d86-4692-91ea-cfb4e12774d8" label="text-like">Canticle of zachary (New psalter, p. G84)</l><l xml:id="m-aca14113-8ee0-46ba-83df-446f71cf0bb3" facs="#m-c6454f12-65e8-4b8a-91e5-46b1b0f222a9" label="ambiguous">Luke 1, 68-79</l><l xml:id="m-af9e495e-a333-45f2-9b67-de828b3274a8" facs="#m-03372a5a-8940-4879-b8ff-9828d71a915b" label="lyrics-like">1. Be- ne- di- ctus Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d915e6d-d5db-4915-943c-ac4eaf877c56" facs="#m-9f7b638b-e946-4484-aefb-b22d37e75fd8" label="lyrics-like">nus, Dé- us I- sra¬ el,</l><l xml:id="m-3a6a3c8e-2588-4673-a45a-2cb8c444f23b" facs="#m-ffc19823-d6d1-4887-9a9b-c647ae86863d" label="lyrics-like">tis nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7a86dc8-92e3-4284-9257-34129e3a8ebb" facs="#m-43213e36-7c17-4098-b2c7-14ae17717a89" label="ambiguous">bis,</l><l xml:id="m-6158961e-5436-41ab-9a72-bb94bbe42825" facs="#m-0aa044f1-e586-45ac-93bb-cd8306131926" label="ambiguous">2.Et e¬</l><l xml:id="m-4adf9993-76f5-4a4f-a155-1d24d60c2f39" facs="#m-e76dcbfa-8c57-45c2-998f-ea5b9c29e67e" label="lyrics-like">sa- lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-33427e3b-054f-40d6-a832-bd11aba191d4" facs="#m-153274cb-88a4-427e-b6f2-713647c187f5" label="lyrics-like">ré- xit córnu</l><l xml:id="m-893ec92c-de12-4b49-9a52-6fc32ba50686" facs="#m-890098b0-911b-48b4-9981-d8a84eaa96b3" label="lyrics-like">lo- cútus est</l><l xml:id="m-5483d8b0-8085-4937-b523-a3cc18fa2eee" facs="#m-9912d8f5-0664-43a9-9fcb-66c661b78433" label="ambiguous">3. Sic-ut</l><l xml:id="m-488af2fd-fe1c-401b-8b8a-d640e868b0c5" facs="#m-7dc53fd2-8e23-4e32-9351-a05ac353eab2" label="lyrics-like">san- ctó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7a74361-a3ca-4e18-bde9-c3dfec32503c" facs="#m-4664158d-5764-4d6f-823d-16ba49416fd3" label="ambiguous">per os</l><l xml:id="m-ee2529c4-fb10-412f-bf6e-d42319e36444" facs="#m-566d2bdc-5d7f-413e-9a2a-7fb385c232a1" label="ambiguous">rum,</l><l xml:id="m-579159ed-ad29-47bc-91ca-171e800febdb" facs="#m-d24fc8fc-5cbc-4f9d-9123-0d2cad88a568" label="lyrics-like">4. Sa- lú- tem ex in¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f1ab67b-ea14-40c0-a8b1-0b627c18b1b5" facs="#m-fc28f9ac-c697-4a22-a3d2-ab7939636a61" label="ambiguous">stris,</l><l xml:id="m-707019b4-711e-4839-9cef-a3a7b685bafb" facs="#m-f4d23fc4-4bd7-436a-8496-a8ace43579b3" label="lyrics-like">cis nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-010bbdcd-64c1-4a91-ac72-1e7165dfd751" facs="#m-128d6beb-7bef-425a-a0e5-4fd8a3fef6f7" label="lyrics-like">i- mí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec973a17-56db-49ac-ac6b-571887450f37" facs="#m-6064620d-be98-4b7a-9415-9aab9a727ee2" label="lyrics-like">5.Ad fa- ci- éndam misericórdiam</l><l xml:id="m-9c1f730e-4ffc-4f48-b581-cb71d409d0fe" facs="#m-1f1ddd59-7205-42f0-93d5-82f4c0d8c975" label="ambiguous">stris:</l><l xml:id="m-0cc26ae9-8fc5-41fa-a746-8285dcc88603" facs="#m-363580d1-978a-4323-a967-fec2bffdc047" label="lyrics-like">cum pá¬ ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-0dfe5af1-ee72-4613-acb6-94ad0dc5af09" facs="#m-561dac22-c625-4278-8bff-bb60fece5d4e" label="lyrics-like">bus nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-56619527-2eb4-407c-9c7e-da66f135c3db" facs="#m-653b9e0e-c866-414e-a11b-3a8ad0a4255b" label="ambiguous">6. Jus-ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-0eed2991-ae7f-4e94-998d-cf19d9efd9c5" facs="#m-6f483e72-34a4-48ae-907c-18a6b1242081" label="lyrics-like">rán-dum, quod jurávit ad</l><l xml:id="m-36371705-8317-4b06-ba3d-4261e124d4a1" facs="#m-83f54146-1ecf-4c1d-a9b0-d752a053614a" label="lyrics-like">Abra-ham pá¬ tem nó- strum,</l><l xml:id="m-aef04039-47a0-4667-a3f7-6414512fd91f" facs="#m-d7d44aed-7658-4808-99b6-bf4f40fa04b7" label="lyrics-like">Ut si- ne timóre, de mánu inimi¬</l><l xml:id="m-df577a86-dd48-4a32-821a-90206b87bddb" facs="#m-ed2763c8-2c82-46b1-af8f-2d20c0c72f13" label="ambiguous">ti,</l><l xml:id="m-1ad577c1-8687-46e1-a2a1-78769f9