><l xml:id="m-9d2a1572-4643-4a4d-b6f7-abd668d7bfb2" facs="#m-475bf587-b287-4ccd-a0c3-d46bcc1a06c9" label="lyrics-like">O caritátis infúnde:"*ut, quos</l><l xml:id="m-2a5082c6-7b95-4b1b-a0c8-ac378b5608ab" facs="#m-854da1b2-75c7-4885-94d3-f5f6aed1121a" label="lyrics-like">sacraméntis paschálibus satiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d2285bf-27fe-4b24-b312-9a2bae4f3213" facs="#m-ec6acca4-6fb2-4bd2-894a-dcba22417877" label="lyrics-like">tecum vivit et regnat in unitãte</l><l xml:id="m-bef38a2b-8a18-4ed4-b386-dec3f1a0af31" facs="#m-539c8b6c-5600-4fd5-a29c-c915f33583fa" label="lyrics-like">sti, tua fácias pietâte concórdes.! ejúsdem Spiritus Sancti Deus...</l></lg>
